[
  {
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "Carol 在安全处切回保洁，刷开 309。Terese 扑过来时，Carol 闻见她衣领上还有一点柑橘香。墨绿蝴蝶结已经松了，一缕头发贴在她脸上。",
    "mode": "narration",
    "expression": "none",
    "portrait": false,
    "scene": "",
    "source_line": 412,
    "beat_id": "complete_118",
    "frame": "approach",
    "narration": true,
    "speaker_id": "NARRATOR"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Terese",
    "text": "Carol……？我以为又是他们来收盘子。",
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "expression": "neutral",
    "portrait": false,
    "scene": "",
    "source_line": 414,
    "beat_id": "complete_119",
    "frame": "approach",
    "narration": false,
    "speaker_id": "TERESE"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Carol",
    "text": "是我。你先松一点……我快喘不过气了。",
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "expression": "neutral",
    "portrait": false,
    "scene": "",
    "source_line": 416,
    "beat_id": "complete_120",
    "frame": "hug",
    "narration": false,
    "speaker_id": "CAROL"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "Terese 松开一点，手还是攥着 Carol 的袖口。",
    "mode": "narration",
    "expression": "none",
    "portrait": false,
    "scene": "",
    "source_line": 418,
    "beat_id": "complete_121",
    "frame": "hug",
    "narration": true,
    "speaker_id": "NARRATOR"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Carol",
    "text": "第一天晚上，你说下班给我发消息。",
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "expression": "neutral",
    "portrait": false,
    "scene": "",
    "source_line": 420,
    "beat_id": "complete_122",
    "frame": "hug",
    "narration": false,
    "speaker_id": "CAROL"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Terese",
    "text": "他们上班前把手机收走了。我下班去拿，经理说得做满三天。我说工资也不要了，她就让我到这儿等离店批准。",
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "expression": "neutral",
    "portrait": false,
    "scene": "",
    "source_line": 422,
    "beat_id": "complete_123",
    "frame": "hug",
    "narration": false,
    "speaker_id": "TERESE"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Carol",
    "text": "然后呢？",
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "expression": "neutral",
    "portrait": false,
    "scene": "",
    "source_line": 424,
    "beat_id": "complete_124",
    "frame": "hug",
    "narration": false,
    "speaker_id": "CAROL"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Terese",
    "text": "她在外面锁了门。第二天我问她批了没有，她说……前台根本没收到过我的申请。",
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "expression": "neutral",
    "portrait": false,
    "scene": "",
    "source_line": 426,
    "beat_id": "complete_125",
    "frame": "hug",
    "narration": false,
    "speaker_id": "TERESE"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "Carol 低头看了一眼桌上那份没动过的饭。",
    "mode": "narration",
    "expression": "none",
    "portrait": false,
    "scene": "",
    "source_line": 428,
    "beat_id": "complete_126",
    "frame": "hug",
    "narration": true,
    "speaker_id": "NARRATOR"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Carol",
    "text": "还能走吗？",
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "expression": "neutral",
    "portrait": false,
    "scene": "",
    "source_line": 430,
    "beat_id": "complete_127",
    "frame": "leave",
    "narration": false,
    "speaker_id": "CAROL"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Terese",
    "text": "能。楼下员工通道锁了。我听送饭的人说，五楼最右边有个消防出口。",
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "expression": "neutral",
    "portrait": false,
    "scene": "",
    "source_line": 432,
    "beat_id": "complete_128",
    "frame": "leave",
    "narration": false,
    "speaker_id": "TERESE"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Carol",
    "text": "好。你指路，我走前面。",
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "expression": "neutral",
    "portrait": false,
    "scene": "",
    "source_line": 434,
    "beat_id": "complete_129",
    "frame": "leave",
    "narration": false,
    "speaker_id": "CAROL"
  }
]
